{"id":4138,"date":"2024-03-14T16:17:40","date_gmt":"2024-03-14T16:17:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4138"},"modified":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","modified_gmt":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","slug":"ccac-visits-top-uk-comprehensive","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/ccac-visits-top-uk-comprehensive\/","title":{"rendered":"CCAC visits top UK comprehensive"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1650\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4143 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1-300x193.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1-1024x660.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1-768x495.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1-1536x990.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1-2048x1320.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1-310x200.jpg 310w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/piano-1-194x125.jpg 194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1650;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>\u2026and so to Bishop\u2019s Stortford and Hockerill Anglo-European College, which is rated by The Good Schools Guide as \u201cone of the most successful comprehensives in the country\u201d.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Uniquely, this state school offers boarding accommodation and the International Baccalaureate\u2019s Middle Years and Diploma programmes. With a twin focus on its specialisms of languages and music, the College offers a truly distinct setting for a world-class education.\u00a0 As we were guided around the well-appointed campus by two animated students, the opportunities for a genuinely holistic education with freedom to develop personal passions became abundantly clear.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"658\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1-1024x658.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4152 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1-1024x658.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1-300x193.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1-768x493.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1-1536x987.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1-311x200.jpg 311w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1-195x125.jpg 195w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/science-1.jpg 2000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/658;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Unsurprisingly Hockerill lists <a href=\"https:\/\/www.hockerill.com\/about-hockerill\/school-vision-ethos\">\u201csustainable development\u201d <\/a>as one of its five guiding values. The school pledges to tackle national and international issues with its students, and their Year 11 Programme focuses on the UN\u2019s Sustainable Development Goals (SDG).\u00a0 Their objective to achieve a carbon-neutral campus, supported by a recent application to install 660 solar panels on its roofs, places green living as a top priority.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1650\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4139 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students-300x193.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students-1024x660.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students-768x495.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students-1536x990.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students-2048x1320.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students-310x200.jpg 310w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/cedar-lawn-with-students-194x125.jpg 194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1650;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC and Hockerill\u2019s shared interest in a broad, creative curriculum and raising awareness of the impacts of climate change has been cemented by two CCAC board members joining Hockerill\u2019s panel of patrons and the College\u2019s enthusiastic endorsement of CCAC\u2019s activities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"288\" height=\"95\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/haec-logo.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4142 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/haec-logo.png 288w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/haec